    {
      "episode": 1,
      "episodeNumber": 1,
      "title": "The Day a New Demon Was Born",
      "aired": "2006-10-06T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-10-06T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740097ab3966adbc_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740097ab3966adbc_w.webp",
      "description": "Lelouch Lamperouge finds himself caught in a clash between an anti-government terrorist group and the Britannian army. When things take a turn from bad to worse, a mysterious green-haired girl bestows a dangerous power upon him, changing his life forever."
    },
    {
      "episode": 2,
      "episodeNumber": 2,
      "title": "The White Knight Awakens",
      "aired": "2006-10-13T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-10-13T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400952079643d83_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400952079643d83_w.webp",
      "description": "Lelouch teams up with the terrorist group to take down the army as they destroy Shinjuku Ghetto. But when Suzaku is put in control of the army’s newest Knightmare model, will Lelouch’s plan fall apart? Or can he still move the pieces in his favor?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 3,
      "episodeNumber": 3,
      "title": "The False Classmate",
      "aired": "2006-10-20T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-10-20T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740093d883e5ac25_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740093d883e5ac25_w.webp",
      "description": "After confronting Prince Clovis, Lelouch learns information about his mother’s murder. Back at school, he is surprised to find that one of the terrorists he worked with is a fellow classmate. But when he confronts her, he finds the limits of his new power."
    },
    {
      "episode": 4,
      "episodeNumber": 4,
      "title": "His Name Is Zero",
      "aired": "2006-10-27T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-10-27T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740091c6edf4d6f3_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740091c6edf4d6f3_w.webp",
      "description": "Suzaku is accused of the murder of Prince Clovis, and Lelouch must save him. But to do so could mean revealing himself to the army. With a new alter ego and the help of Kallen and her comrade, they must try to pull off a daring and public rescue."
    },
    {
      "episode": 5,
      "episodeNumber": 5,
      "title": "The Princess and the Witch",
      "aired": "2006-11-03T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-11-03T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740089d94c4b6d54_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740089d94c4b6d54_w.webp",
      "description": "The mysterious green-haired girl known as C.C. is alive and intent on hanging around Lelouch as he accepted the contract and the Geass Power. Meanwhile, Suzaku is set free and encounters a strange girl who calls herself Euphie."
    },
    {
      "episode": 6,
      "episodeNumber": 6,
      "title": "The Stolen Mask",
      "aired": "2006-11-10T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-11-10T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400872a93c44746_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400872a93c44746_w.webp",
      "description": "Suzaku enrolls in Lelouch’s class at Ashford Academy and is avoided by everyone. While Suzaku struggles to fit in at the school, Lelouch loses his Zero mask to…a cat? Milly turns the cat hunt into a game for the student body, much to Lelouch’s dismay."
    },
    {
      "episode": 7,
      "episodeNumber": 7,
      "title": "Attack Cornelia",
      "aired": "2006-11-17T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-11-17T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/574008541df63118e_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/574008541df63118e_w.webp",
      "description": "Viceroy Cornelia sets a trap to lure Zero out. C.C. tries to stop him, but Lelouch plans on making an appearance despite the Viceroy’s plot. But will the “Goddess of Victory” prove to be a more cunning opponent?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 8,
      "episodeNumber": 8,
      "title": "The Black Knights",
      "aired": "2006-11-24T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-11-24T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740083a2344ecd92_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740083a2344ecd92_w.webp",
      "description": "While Lelouch forms his knights of justice, the Japan Liberation Front takes tourists hostage including Lelouch’s friends and the Princess Euphemia. Will their rescue require Lelouch to work on the same side as Cornelia, or does he have other plans?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 9,
      "episodeNumber": 9,
      "title": "Refrain",
      "aired": "2006-12-08T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-12-08T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740081b0216ccf28_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740081b0216ccf28_w.webp",
      "description": "A drug known as ‘Refrain’ is rampant on the street and being pushed on the Japanese citizens. The Black Knights become involved, and Kallen’s biological mother turns out to be a victim of the drug."
    },
    {
      "episode": 10,
      "episodeNumber": 10,
      "title": "Guren Dances",
      "aired": "2006-12-15T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-12-15T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/574007955b0f15830_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/574007955b0f15830_w.webp",
      "description": "As the Black Knights grow in numbers they gain more resources and new weapons. Lelouch devises a plan to trap Cornelia when she stages an attack against the Japan Liberation Front in Narita. Will their new weapons prove their worth?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 11,
      "episodeNumber": 11,
      "title": "Battle for Narita",
      "aired": "2006-12-22T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2006-12-22T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/574007796a9cdaeff_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/574007796a9cdaeff_w.webp",
      "description": "After taking out the majority of Cornelia’s troops, the Black Knights work towards cornering her. Right when Lelouch thinks he can declare checkmate, Suzaku appears to protect the Viceroy. And when C.C. comes to his aid, her powers reveal more about her."
    },
    {
      "episode": 12,
      "episodeNumber": 12,
      "title": "The Messenger from Kyoto",
      "aired": "2007-01-05T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-01-05T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740075284d7f78ac_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740075284d7f78ac_w.webp",
      "description": "Impressed by the Black Knights’ performance, the Kyoto suppliers seek council with them. If the meeting goes well, it could mean better resources and weapons. But when the leader demands to see Zero`s face or no deal, will Lelouch make that sacrifice?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 13,
      "episodeNumber": 13,
      "title": "Shirley at Gunpoint",
      "aired": "2007-01-12T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-01-12T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740073606f488e38_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740073606f488e38_w.webp",
      "description": "The Black Knights set out to work with the J.L.F., supposedly siding with them, but Lelouch has something else up his sleeve. When the plan begins to go awry, Lelouch may have his secret revealed in front of the last person he expects."
    },
    {
      "episode": 14,
      "episodeNumber": 14,
      "title": "Geass vs. Geass",
      "aired": "2007-01-19T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-01-19T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740071a70a4c099c_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740071a70a4c099c_w.webp",
      "description": "Lelouch has to figure out who saw him before his identity is revealed to others, but when it turns out to be someone close to him, is he prepared for the consequences? When a second Geass user shows up, his situation becomes even more complicated."
    },
    {
      "episode": 15,
      "episodeNumber": 15,
      "title": "Cheering Mao",
      "aired": "2007-01-26T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-01-26T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740069a36112fb38_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740069a36112fb38_w.webp",
      "description": "C.C. reveals the truth behind Mao`s Geass and his intentions to take her back. But what truths about the Geass and Mao is she leaving out? Lelouch could have yet another enemy to watch out for."
    },
    {
      "episode": 16,
      "episodeNumber": 16,
      "title": "Nunnally Held Hostage",
      "aired": "2007-02-02T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-02-02T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740067a14c347d4b_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740067a14c347d4b_w.webp",
      "description": "Nunnally is taken hostage, but Lelouch has little time to save her and no idea where she could be. Can he accept help from Suzaku, or will he risk exposing everything?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 17,
      "episodeNumber": 17,
      "title": "Knight",
      "aired": "2007-02-09T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-02-09T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400655d727e835f_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400655d727e835f_w.webp",
      "description": "Lelouch has the chance to gain more allies: Tohdoh from the J.L.F. and more importantly, Suzaku. But when Lelouch learns the truth behind the pilot of the white Knightmare, his plans could fall to pieces."
    },
    {
      "episode": 18,
      "episodeNumber": 18,
      "title": "I Order You, Suzaku Kururugi",
      "aired": "2007-02-23T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-02-23T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740063e9fd78b336_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740063e9fd78b336_w.webp",
      "description": "Suzaku is appointed to be the princess’ royal knight, leaving Lelouch to struggle with the decision of what to do about him. He wants Suzaku on his side, but will using the Geass on another loved one be the choice he has to make?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 19,
      "episodeNumber": 19,
      "title": "Island of the Gods",
      "aired": "2007-03-02T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-03-02T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400613523ec531f_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400613523ec531f_w.webp",
      "description": "Suzaku and Lelouch wake up on an island with no memory of what happened to them after the Avalon’s appearance. But Lelouch has more to worry about when Princess Euphemia reveals she knows Zero’s identity."
    },
    {
      "episode": 20,
      "episodeNumber": 20,
      "title": "The Battle for Kyushu",
      "aired": "2007-03-09T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-03-09T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740059e3c2f09282_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/5740059e3c2f09282_w.webp",
      "description": "The Chinese Federation makes their move, claiming to support the J.L.F. The Black Knights refuse to be tied to them while the Britannian Empire plans to push back the attack. When given little choice, Suzaku must decide to work with Zero or give up."
    },
    {
      "episode": 21,
      "episodeNumber": 21,
      "title": "The School Festival Declaration",
      "aired": "2007-03-16T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-03-16T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400576eb03f189e_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400576eb03f189e_w.webp",
      "description": "Instead of getting time to work on his coup d’état, Lelouch is stuck working the school festival with the student council. Things get chaotic when the event attracts everyone, including Britannian soldiers and Euphemia, who makes a startling announcement."
    },
    {
      "episode": 22,
      "episodeNumber": 22,
      "title": "Bloodstained Euphy",
      "aired": "2007-03-23T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-03-23T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400555ddf3e2d23_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400555ddf3e2d23_w.webp",
      "description": "With the Nippon special zone plans going forward, it seems there will be no need for a group like the Black Knights. Lelouch has a plan to make it work in his favor, but when things don’t go as planned, it could lead to something much worse."
    },
    {
      "episode": 23,
      "episodeNumber": 23,
      "title": "At Least with Sorrow",
      "aired": "2007-03-30T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-03-30T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400538d6ec7f105_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400538d6ec7f105_w.webp",
      "description": "Lelouch takes advantage of the ceremony’s tragedy to finally declare the independence of Japan. With the change to his Geass, he’ll have to make more sacrifices or else it could lead to more misfortune. For the revenge he seeks, it may be what he needs."
    },
    {
      "episode": 24,
      "episodeNumber": 24,
      "title": "The Collapsing Stage",
      "aired": "2007-07-29T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-07-29T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400518c1153277b_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/57400518c1153277b_w.webp",
      "description": "As the Black Knights gain control, Lelouch presses forward towards the army. A mysterious boy named V.V. informs Suzaku of Zero’s powers, which enrages the young man, sending him on a tear to get his revenge for Euphemia. Revenge Cornelia seeks as well."
    },
    {
      "episode": 25,
      "episodeNumber": 25,
      "title": "Zero",
      "aired": "2007-07-29T01:25:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2007-07-29T01:25:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/574004916b203423a_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/57/574004916b203423a_w.webp",
      "description": "With Cornelia at his mercy, Lelouch seeks answers about his mother’s death. Suddenly, C.C. tells him that Nunnally has been kidnapped and that he must leave. Without Zero in the battle, can the Black Knights survive? Or will it all end with Suzaku’s vengeance?"
    }
  ],
